<ThingDef ParentName="RL_CargoBase"><defName>RL_CargoManualUp</defName><designatorDropdown>RL_CargoAdjacentGroup</designatorDropdown><label>manual item hoist (up)</label><description>A three-stack storage basket shared by connected floors. Pawns haul items into the basket and call it before taking items out. Only actual basket contents can be retrieved remotely. Does not carry people or create floors.</description>
